1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,310
Having a newborn can be daunting.
有一个新生儿可能会令人生畏。

2
00:00:03,310 --> 00:00:05,630
What do you need to buy?
你需要买些什么呢？

3
00:00:05,630 --> 00:00:08,440
How will you get the baby to sleep?
你要如何让宝宝入睡呢？

4
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:11,690
And how will you pay for everything?
你要如何支付所有的费用呢？

5
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:17,550
Could the answers to these worries lie in a 'baby box'?
解决这些烦恼的答案会在一个“婴儿礼盒”里吗？

6
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:24,460
The baby box has taken the world by storm, but what is it?
婴儿礼盒已经风靡全球，但它究竟是什么呢？

7
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:37,190
Well, it originated in Finland in the 1930s as a kind of maternity kit for expectant parents provided by the government.
嗯，它起源于20世纪30年代的芬兰，是政府提供给准父母的一种产妇用品套装。

8
00:00:37,190 --> 00:00:44,030
The box contains supplies, such as bibs, nappies, and teething toys.
这个礼盒包含有围嘴、尿布和出牙期玩具等用品。

9
00:00:44,030 --> 00:00:53,750
It also comes with a small mattress, which is placed in the bottom of the box to create the baby's first cot.
它还配有一个小床垫，这个床垫被放在礼盒底部，就成了宝宝的第一张婴儿床。

10
00:00:53,750 --> 00:01:00,300
Now, the idea of putting a child to sleep in a box may shock some.
现在，把孩子放在礼盒里睡觉的想法可能会让一些人感到震惊。

11
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:08,830
But, experts say this could reduce the risks that come with babies sleeping in the same bed as their parents.
但是，专家说这可以降低宝宝和父母睡在同一张床上所带来的风险。

12
00:01:08,830 --> 00:01:20,910
The box has been a huge success and is said to be one of the main reasons why the rate of infant mortality in Finland is so low.
这个礼盒取得了巨大的成功，据说它也是为什么芬兰婴儿死亡率如此之低的主要原因之一。

13
00:01:20,910 --> 00:01:27,170
A few years ago, stories of the Finnish baby box went viral.
几年前，芬兰婴儿礼盒的故事迅速传播开来。

14
00:01:27,170 --> 00:01:35,390
Other countries around the world have since caught onto the idea and adapted to suit local needs.
从那以后，世界上其他国家也开始接受这个主意，并调整以适应当地的需求。

15
00:01:35,390 --> 00:01:44,850
For example, in South Africa, the box is made of plastic and can be used as a bath rather than a bed.
例如，在南非，这种礼盒是用塑料制成的，被用来当澡盆，而不是婴儿床。

16
00:01:44,850 --> 00:01:53,170
The main objective, however, is to encourage mothers to attend antenatal classes during their pregnancy.
然而，其主要目的是鼓励准妈妈们在怀孕期间参加产前课程。

17
00:01:53,170 --> 00:02:04,950
The version trialled in India includes other appropriate supplies, such as a mosquito net to protect babies from malaria.
在印度试用的版本里还包括其他适宜的日常用品，比如一个用来保护宝宝免受疟疾侵害的蚊帐。

18
00:02:04,950 --> 00:02:16,820
In Canada, additions to the baby box include a "crib-side assistance booklet" to help fathers bond with their baby.
在加拿大，婴儿礼盒里增加了一本“婴儿床边辅助手册”，以帮助爸爸们与宝宝建立亲密关系。

19
00:02:16,820 --> 00:02:28,400
Written in the style of a car-repair manual, the booklet offers first-time dads helpful advice on matters such as how to burp their child.
这本手册采用汽车维修手册的风格编写，为准爸爸们在如何给孩子拍嗝等问题上提供了有用的建议。

20
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:33,530
Of course, the baby box can only do so much.
当然，婴儿礼盒能做的只有这么多。

21
00:02:33,530 --> 00:02:44,830
Many believe governments should focus on providing parents with adequate maternity leave and paternity leave and improving health care and education.
许多人认为政府应该专注于为准父母们提供足够的产假和陪产假，并改善医疗保健和教育条件。

22
00:02:44,830 --> 00:02:54,540
Good things come in small packages though, and for such a simple idea the baby box really does tick a lot of boxes!
不过，好东西往往藏于小包装中，对于这样一个简单的想法，婴儿礼盒确实满足了很多需求！
